+// the v0/v1 the function wrote: anything else in the context still holds what the callee will
+// find in its locals. Ignored, reimplemented, stubbed and hooked functions, and calls this cannot
+// resolve exactly as the code generator will (relocated, static, indirect, syscalls), take all of
